---------------------------------------
This version has been modified by amanIT GmbH, starting June 2026 and
continuing. The modified files, the nature of each change and its date are
recorded in the Git history of the fork repository:

    https://github.com/lamanese/PatchMon

Every release of the fork is tagged (v<upstream-base>-am.<n>, for example
v2.0.2-am.11). The tag matching the running version is shown in the
application under Settings -> Server Version, and a link to the source is
